Decorator Design Pattern:
It is used when we want to add responsibilties to object dynamically without modifying the class.
Like adding new features.
EX:-
Pizza Topping System:
1: Pizza is base class in it we can add different toppings and the price will be recalculated based on prices of each topping.
Problems Solved:
1: Class Explosion (Avoid creating multiple subclasses)
2: Add functanity at runtime
3: Reusability
